{
    "title": "Samsung Global Goals",
    "description": "Samsung Global Goals - Take Action for a Better World\r\n\r\nJoin the movement for a sustainable future with the Samsung Global Goals app. Discover, learn, and contribute to the United Nations' Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) right from your smartphone and smartwatch (Wear OS). Engage in meaningful actions, track your progress, and make a positive impact on the world.\r\n\r\nLearn about the 17 Global Goals, earn money, and donate to your favorite Goal.\r\n\r\nApp features:\r\nGain insights into the 17 Sustainable Development Goals through interactive content, wallpapers, and informative articles.\r\nGet involved in campaigns, challenges, and initiatives that address global issues and contribute to real-world change.\r\nMonitor your personal contributions, track your progress, and see the collective impact of the Samsung Global Goals community.\r\nAccess educational resources, inspiring stories, and expert advice to deepen your understanding and inspire others.\r\nDownload the Samsung Global Goals app today and become part of a global movement working towards a sustainable and inclusive future for all.\r\nExpand your experience using our various Samsung Galaxy watch faces, watch app, and complication features.\r\n\r\nAbout the app:\r\nThe Samsung Global Goals app, brought to you by Samsung in partnership with the UNDP, puts the future of our planet in your hands. As the leading global manufacturer of Android devices, we believe in our role as a responsible corporate citizen, investing in a sustainable future like never before.  With your support, we aspire to ignite a worldwide movement by spreading awareness about the #GlobalGoals campaign. Together, let's channel our time and attention towards making a significant impact.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how it works:\r\nDownload and Install the apps: for your phone and watch.\r\nUse your phone and watch like you always do.\r\nSee interesting wallpapers and ads. Any ads you see from this app, earn money for donations that support the Global Goals.\r\nAccumulate earnings.\r\nDonate to your favorite Goals. All of the donations from the ads displayed by this app will be made by Samsung to the United Nations Development Program.\r\n\r\nApp permissions:\r\nNotifications are optional in the app and used to provide you with timely information and reminders of important calendar dates related to the Global Goals.  You can still use the app's basic functions without allowing the optional permission.\r\n\r\nAbout the UN's SDGs:\r\nThe 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development was adopted by all United Nations Member States in 2015, and provides a shared blueprint for peace and prosperity for people and the planet, now and into the future. At its heart are the 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), which are an urgent call for action by all countries - developed and developing - in a global partnership. They recognize that ending poverty and other deprivations must go hand-in-hand with strategies that improve health and education, reduce inequality, and spur economic growth \u2013 all while tackling climate change and working to preserve our oceans and forests.\r\n\r\nThe clock is ticking, and the time for change is now. Together, we can overcome challenges that once seemed insurmountable and forge a path towards a more sustainable and equitable future.\r\n\r\nFor more information:\r\nhttps://www.samsung.com/global/sustainability/\r\nhttps://globalgoals.org\r\nhttp://www.undp.org\r\n\r\n\u201cUnless we act now, the 2030 Agenda will become an epitaph for a world that might have been.\u201d \r\n-Ant\u00f3nio Guterres, Secretary-General, United Nations",
    "descriptionHTML": "Samsung Global Goals - Take Action for a Better World<br><br>Join the movement for a sustainable future with the Samsung Global Goals app. Discover, learn, and contribute to the United Nations&#39; Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) right from your smartphone and smartwatch (Wear OS). Engage in meaningful actions, track your progress, and make a positive impact on the world.<br><br>Learn about the 17 Global Goals, earn money, and donate to your favorite Goal.<br><br>App features:<br>Gain insights into the 17 Sustainable Development Goals through interactive content, wallpapers, and informative articles.<br>Get involved in campaigns, challenges, and initiatives that address global issues and contribute to real-world change.<br>Monitor your personal contributions, track your progress, and see the collective impact of the Samsung Global Goals community.<br>Access educational resources, inspiring stories, and expert advice to deepen your understanding and inspire others.<br>Download the Samsung Global Goals app today and become part of a global movement working towards a sustainable and inclusive future for all.<br>Expand your experience using our various Samsung Galaxy watch faces, watch app, and complication features.<br><br>About the app:<br>The Samsung Global Goals app, brought to you by Samsung in partnership with the UNDP, puts the future of our planet in your hands. As the leading global manufacturer of Android devices, we believe in our role as a responsible corporate citizen, investing in a sustainable future like never before.  With your support, we aspire to ignite a worldwide movement by spreading awareness about the #GlobalGoals campaign. Together, let&#39;s channel our time and attention towards making a significant impact.<br><br>Here\u2019s how it works:<br>Download and Install the apps: for your phone and watch.<br>Use your phone and watch like you always do.<br>See interesting wallpapers and ads. Any ads you see from this app, earn money for donations that support the Global Goals.<br>Accumulate earnings.<br>Donate to your favorite Goals. All of the donations from the ads displayed by this app will be made by Samsung to the United Nations Development Program.<br><br>App permissions:<br>Notifications are optional in the app and used to provide you with timely information and reminders of important calendar dates related to the Global Goals.  You can still use the app&#39;s basic functions without allowing the optional permission.<br><br>About the UN&#39;s SDGs:<br>The 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development was adopted by all United Nations Member States in 2015, and provides a shared blueprint for peace and prosperity for people and the planet, now and into the future. At its heart are the 17 Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs), which are an urgent call for action by all countries - developed and developing - in a global partnership. They recognize that ending poverty and other deprivations must go hand-in-hand with strategies that improve health and education, reduce inequality, and spur economic growth \u2013 all while tackling climate change and working to preserve our oceans and forests.<br><br>The clock is ticking, and the time for change is now. Together, we can overcome challenges that once seemed insurmountable and forge a path towards a more sustainable and equitable future.<br><br>For more information:<br>https://www.samsung.com/global/sustainability/<br>https://globalgoals.org<br>http://www.undp.org<br><br>\u201cUnless we act now, the 2030 Agenda will become an epitaph for a world that might have been.\u201d <br>-Ant\u00f3nio Guterres, Secretary-General, United Nations",
